From 1d05ecdb30ccf8fefbbd01f97f92a46066ea4fa9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 06:02:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix generated-UI drag/resize sending elements behind design +
 add live collab edits

- Lift elements above the design's own Tailwind z-index layers (LIFT_BASE)
  so dragging/resizing an element no longer pushes it (or the text/image it
  covers) behind the design sections. Applies on lift, drag-end and resize-end.
- Resize now restores a proper stacking z (previously left at max-int).
- Broadcast in-progress drag/resize/typing edits to collaborators in near
  real time via a new non-history liveUpdateShape action (keeps the whole
  gesture as a single undo step) plus an autosave maxWait flush so continuous
  gestures actually sync mid-drag instead of only after release.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
